WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.205
Week 10: Likes, Preferences, and Leisure. express likes and dislikes invite and suggest compare activities

2
00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:15.369
Form and meaning. Gustar-type verbs; indirect-object pronouns; infinitives after preference verbs; comparisons.

3
00:00:15.369 --> 00:00:42.267
Model set. Me gusta escuchar música en vivo. A Tomás le interesan los documentales. ¿Prefieres salir o quedarte en casa? Nos encanta jugar juntos. El senderismo es más tranquilo que el fútbol. I like listening to live music. Tomás is interested in documentaries. Do you prefer going out or staying home? We love playing together. Hiking is calmer than soccer.

4
00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:52.419
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:52.419 --> 00:01:04.575
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: express likes and dislikes; invite and suggest; compare activities. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:04.575 --> 00:01:32.284
Model language. Me gusta escuchar música en vivo. — I like listening to live music. A Tomás le interesan los documentales. — Tomás is interested in documentaries. ¿Prefieres salir o quedarte en casa? — Do you prefer going out or staying home? Nos encanta jugar juntos. — We love playing together. El senderismo es más tranquilo que el fútbol. — Hiking is calmer than soccer.

7
00:01:32.284 --> 00:01:42.182
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
